        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Johns Hopkins University, Northwestern University\n- Places: Baltimore, Maryland; Evanston, Illinois; Chicago; Doha, Qatar; Washington, D.C.; San Francisco, California\n- People: Charles L. Christ\n- Topics: Higher education, research universities, academic degrees\n\nFacts:\n- Johns Hopkins University is an American private research university in Baltimore, Maryland.\n- Charles L. Christ received his Bachelor's, Master's, and Doctoral degrees from Johns Hopkins University and completed his Ph.D. in 1940.\n- Northwestern University is a private research university based in Evanston, Illinois.\n- Northwestern University also has campuses in Chicago and Doha, Qatar, and academic programs and facilities in Washington, D.C., and San Francisco, California.",
